<h3 dir="auto">Specification signature on loop block</h3>
<p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">verus_spec</code> will insert other loop specification (e.g, invariant) into the loop block</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role="table">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-rust notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="#[verus_spec(v =&gt; ensures true)]
fn test_for_loop(n: u32) -&gt; Vec&lt;u32&gt; {
    let mut v: Vec&lt;u32&gt; = Vec::new();

    #[verus_spec(
       invariant
           v@ =~= Seq::new(i as nat, |k| k as u32),
    )]
    for i in 0..n {
        v.push(i);
    }
    v
}
