<h3 dir="auto">Proof blocks inside executable function</h3>
<p dir="auto">Inside function body, we prefer to use function-like macro since it does not need to use unstable features.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>proof!{} is similar to proof {} inside verus macro, and all variable declared inside proof!{} is scoped to that proof block; This makes verus!{} user see consistant side effect.</li>
<li>proof_decl!{} allows to declare function-scoped variable and in most cases could replace proof!{}.</li>
</ul>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role="table">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-rust notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="#[verus_spec]
fn g() {
   proof_decl!{
     let ghost mut i = 0;
     assert(true);
   }
   f();
   proof!{
     assert(i == 0);
   }
}

"><pre class="notranslate"><span class="pl-c1">#<span class="pl-kos">[</span>verus_spec<span class="pl-kos">]</span></span>
<span class="pl-k">fn</span> <span class="pl-en">g</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span> <span class="pl-kos">{</span>
   <span class="pl-en">proof_decl</span><span class="pl-en">!</span><span class="pl-kos">{</span>
     <span class="pl-k">let</span> ghost <span class="pl-k">mut</span> i = <span class="pl-c1">0</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
     assert<span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-c1">true</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
   <span class="pl-kos">}</span>
   <span class="pl-en">f</span><span class="pl-kos">(</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
   <span class="pl-en">proof</span><span class="pl-en">!</span><span class="pl-kos">{</span>
     assert<span class="pl-kos">(</span>i == <span class="pl-c1">0</span><span class="pl-kos">)</span><span class="pl-kos">;</span>
   <span class="pl-kos">}</span>
<span class="pl-kos">}</span>
</pre></div>
</td> 
<td>
<div class="highlight highlight-source-rust notranslate position-relative overflow-auto" dir="auto" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content="verus!{
fn g() {
   let ghost mut i = 0;
   proof{
      assert(true);
   }

   f();
