<p></p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">proof_with!{}</code> is just a placeholder. #[verus_spec] is responsible to modify inputs and outputs for the function in the statement followed by proof_with!{}.</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Dual mode for simple functions</h2>
<p dir="auto">If spec function name is not provided, it will generate a random name.</p>
<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role="table">
<tbody><tr>
<td>
