<h2 dir="auto">MISC</h2>
<p dir="auto">When enabling <code class="notranslate">vpanic</code> feature in builtin_macro and <code class="notranslate">allow-panic</code> feature in vstd, #[verus_spec] will allow replace panic!(...) macro to a vstd::pervasive::vpanic!(...) to allow use of panic macro</p>
